[en.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_UNSTABLE]
Military Unrest

[en.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_UNSTABLE_desc]
Who’s spreading those rumors that the Business Alliance is about to collapse?!

Our security teams are almost at the breaking point because of this rumor! We need to prove that we’re still holding out against the Resistance!

[zh.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_UNSTABLE]
军心不稳

[zh.IDEA_C08_MANEHATTAN_UNSTABLE_desc]
是谁在传谣言，说商业联盟崩溃了？！

保安部队已经快要被这个谣言搞到崩溃了！我们必须快点证明我们还在坚持抵抗！
